        // We need to sum 1/(1 + count) over all sequences
        // This is complex, so we use a different approach:
        // Sum over all sequences with at least one player == a1 of 1/(1 + count)
        // = (1/(1+1)) * (ways where exactly 1 player == a1) + (1/(1+2)) * (ways where exactly 2 players == a1) + ...

